## 2. Fraud and Identity Screening

**Problem.** Risk and Compliance needed identity and fraud screening on flagged applications at a volume manual review couldn't keep up with. Every decision also needed an audit trail that could be defended later.

**Solution.** Automated screening sends flagged applications through third-party identity and fraud verification services. It logs results to an audit store and routes cases for disposition in the CRM.

**Impact:** Every flagged application screened automatically. The manual verification bottleneck is gone, and every decision can be traced to logged evidence.

**Stack:** Python · Playwright · REST APIs · Salesforce

---

## 3. Funding Submission Automation

**Problem.** Submitting post-delivery funding packages was a repetitive multi-system sequence: gather documents, submit to the lender channel, update status. It took up significant weekly capacity.

**Solution.** Event-driven automation triggered by CRM delivery status changes. It gathers documentation, submits the funding package, and writes the status back to the CRM. It reuses the shared automation core from System 1, so it was built on proven components.

**Impact:** About 90 seconds per transaction, a weekly workload reduction of more than 90%, and a near-zero operational error rate.

**Stack:** Python · Playwright · Salesforce API

