## How I use AI

AI is an acceleration layer inside system design, not the product. I use it for scaffolding, rapid prototyping, fast debugging cycles, turning failure logs into specifications, and building tool layers that agents can operate safely. I don't use it where every item needs human judgment, where a task runs only once, or where a mistake is expensive and hard to undo.

All AI-assisted work follows employer policy on approved tools and data handling.

